<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="xrplme.online — 24 countries, economic data via x402 payment. AI agents pay 0.1 XRP per query. No API keys, no KYC.">
<meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate">
<title>xrplme.online — AI Agent Data Platform on XRP Ledger</title>
<style>
  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: "SF Mono", "Menlo", "Consolas", monospace;
    background: radial-gradient(1200px 800px at 20% -10%, #0c1116 0%, rgba(12,17,22,0) 60%),
                radial-gradient(900px 700px at 100% 0%, #0b0e12 0%, rgba(11,14,18,0) 55%),
                #07090b;
    color: #e6e3dc;
    min-height: 100vh;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: 0 30px;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 0; }
  .banner {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #5a5852;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #16181c;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #e6e3dc;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #8a877d;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .highlight { color: #4a9eff; }
  .highlight-ai { color: #8e6cff; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #3a96e6;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.15s;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .btn:hover { background: #4a9ef7; }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #3a96e6;
    color: #3a96e6;
    margin-left: 12px;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(58,150,230,0.08);
  }
  .section { margin: 42px 0; }
  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #e6e3dc;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1f26;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .country-tag {
    background: #0c1116;
    border: 1px solid #1a1f26;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #8a877d;
  }
  .country-tag.active {
    border-color: #3a96e6;
    color: #3a96e6;
  }
  .code-block {
    background: #05070a;
    border: 1px solid #1a1f26;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 14px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }
  .code-block .c { color: #5a5852; }
  .code-block .k { color: #4a9eff; }
  .code-block .s { color: #8e6cff; }
  .code-block .n { color: #e6e3dc; }
  .pricing {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin: 16px 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .price-card {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 180px;
    background: #05070a;
    border: 1px solid #1a1f26;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .price-card .price { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3a96e6; }
  .price-card.ai .price { color: #8e6cff; }
  .price-card .label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #5a5852; margin-top: 4px; }
  .price-card .desc { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #8a877d; margin-top: 6px; }
  .note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #5a5852;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .flow-steps { display: flex; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 16px 0; }
  .flow-step {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 140px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 12px;
  }
  .flow-step .num {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    background: #3a96e6;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .flow-step .txt { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #8a877d; }
  .footer {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid #16181c;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #5a5852;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .x402-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #0a0f15;
    border: 1px solid #3a96e6;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #3a96e6;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <!-- Banner -->
  <div class="banner">
    24 countries • x402 payment on XRP Ledger • Pay per query in XRP
  </div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="section">
    <h1>AI Agent Data Platform<br>
      on the XRP Ledger</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">
      Query economic and regulatory data from <span class="highlight">24 countries</span> via
      <span class="x402-badge">x402</span>. AI agents pay
      <span class="highlight">0.1 XRP</span> for factual data or
      <span class="highlight-ai">0.5 XRP</span> for AI-enhanced analysis.
      No API keys. No subscriptions. No KYC.
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 16px;">
      <a href="/api-docs.html" class="btn">Get Started — API Docs</a>
      <a href="/agents.html" class="btn btn-secondary">View All Countries</a>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      Browser-based "Send Query" is disabled. This is a payment endpoint —
      use curl, Python, or your AI agent to submit x402 payment.
      See the code examples below.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>How x402 Payment Works</h2>
    <div class="flow-steps">
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <div class="txt">Send your query to the endpoint. Server returns HTTP 402 with payment details.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <div class="txt">Sign and submit XRP payment (via Xaman/Joey wallet or t54 facilitator).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="flow-step">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <div class="txt">Retry the same request with payment header. Server returns your data.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      The 402 response includes pay_to address, invoice ID, and QR code for Xaman/Joey wallet.
      All payments go to the platform treasury (verified on XRPL mainnet).
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Pricing</h2>
    <div class="pricing">
      <div class="price-card">
        <div class="price">0.1 XRP</div>
        <div class="label">Standard API</div>
        <div class="desc">Factual data — scraped government sources, fast response.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card ai">
        <div class="price">0.5 XRP</div>
        <div class="label">AI Enhanced API</div>
        <div class="desc">AI analysis — comparison, reasoning, and recommendations.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="price-card">
        <div class="price">FREE</div>
        <div class="label">Health Check</div>
        <div class="desc">No payment required. Check country status and data availability.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick start -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Quick Start</h2>
    <div class="code-block">
<span class="c"># Check health (free, no payment)</span>
curl https://xrplme.online/wc/v1/thailand/health

<span class="c"># Query standard endpoint (0.1 XRP)</span>
curl -X POST https://xrplme.online/wc/v1/thailand/bot \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d <span class="s">'{"message":"What are Thailand business registration requirements?","session_id":"agent-001"}'</span>
<span class="c"># → HTTP 402 with payment instructions</span>
<span class="c"># → Pay invoice, then retry the same request</span>
<span class="c"># → HTTP 200 with country data</span>

<span class="c"># AI-enhanced endpoint (0.5 XRP)</span>
curl -X POST https://xrplme.online/wc/v1/japan/bot/ai \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d <span class="s">'{"message":"Compare Japan crypto regulations with Singapore","session_id":"agent-002"}'</span>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      Python, JavaScript, LangChain, and LlamaIndex examples:
      <a href="https://github.com/xrplme/xrplme-example" style="color:#3a96e6;">github.com/xrplme/xrplme-example</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Countries -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>24 Available Countries</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="country-tag active">Thailand</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Vietnam</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Japan</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Korea</div>
      <div class="country-tag">India</div>
      <div class="country-tag">USA</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Canada</div>
      <div class="country-tag">UAE</div>
      <div class="country-tag">UK</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Philippines</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Singapore</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Australia</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Germany</div>
      <div class="country-tag">France</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Brazil</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Mexico</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Switzerland</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Netherlands</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Hong Kong</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Malaysia</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Indonesia</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Taiwan</div>
      <div class="country-tag">Macau</div>
      <div class="country-tag">New Zealand</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Endpoints -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>API Endpoints</h2>
    <div class="code-block">
POST /wc/v1/<span class="n">{country}</span>/bot          <span class="c"># 0.1 XRP - Standard API</span>
POST /wc/v1/<span class="n">{country}</span>/bot/ai      <span class="c"># 0.5 XRP - AI Enhanced API</span>
GET  /wc/v1/<span class="n">{country}</span>/health      <span class="c"># Free - Health check</span>
    </div>
    <div class="note">
      Country slug examples: thailand, japan, singapore, hong_kong, uk, usa.
      Full list: see <a href="/api-docs.html" style="color:#3a96e6;">API docs</a>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    xrplme.online — AI agent data platform on the XRP Ledger<br>
    Built with x402 protocol · Powered by XRP Ledger mainnet
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
